  m_Name: D_PhoneTrigger
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  lines:
  - "H\u1EEDm? M\u1EB9 g\u1ECDi g\xEC m\xECnh v\u1EADy? Th\u1EADt l\u1EA1\u2026 k\u1EC3
    t\u1EEB l\xFAc m\xECnh d\u1EA5n th\xE2n v\xE0o con \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng streamer
    v\xE0 t\u1EEB cha, b\xE0 \u1EA5y \u0111\xE3 c\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EE9t li\xEAn l\u1EA1c
    v\xE0 m\u1EB7c k\u1EC7 m\xECnh t\u1EEB \u0111\xF3  v\u1EDBi m\xECnh t\u1EEB \u0111\xF3."
